      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "KEEP / three concrete strengths observed in source\n1. Checkbox and preview use separate handlers:\n   reading need not alter a batch (main.rs:1245–1283).\n2. Separate bins expose Archive versus Trash intent:\n   counts and Put back (main.rs:1515–1660).\n3. Unknown blocks Apply; recheck is not a write:\n   uncertainty stays honest (main.rs:667–738,1751–1769).",
      "originalText": "KEEP / three concrete strengths observed in source\n1. Checkbox and preview use separate handlers:\n   reading need not alter a batch (main.rs:1245–1283).\n2. Separate bins expose Archive versus Trash intent:\n   counts and Put back (main.rs:1515–1660).\n3. Unknown blocks Apply; recheck is not a write:\n   uncertainty stays honest (main.rs:667–738,1751–1769).",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
