    {
      "id": "change2-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 690,
      "y": 370,
      "width": 549.9,
      "height": 292.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#172b4d",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 11,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1011,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CHANGE 2 / stable targets, literal states\nObserved: hover OR focus reveals actions;\nnot hover-only (main.rs:1181–1200,1254–1269).\nBulk buttons appear conditionally:\nmain.rs:2026–2053. Unread is dot + bold;\npreview uses accent (main.rs:1177–1190).\nPropose an always-present bulk target bar,\nStage N labels, and persistent More menus.\nPrint Read/Unread, Previewing and Checked;\nretain actual checkboxes and focus outline.\nMenu heading states this message/sender N.\nRationale: labels supplement color and make\npreview-versus-action scope inspectable.",
      "originalText": "CHANGE 2 / stable targets, literal states\nObserved: hover OR focus reveals actions;\nnot hover-only (main.rs:1181–1200,1254–1269).\nBulk buttons appear conditionally:\nmain.rs:2026–2053. Unread is dot + bold;\npreview uses accent (main.rs:1177–1190).\nPropose an always-present bulk target bar,\nStage N labels, and persistent More menus.\nPrint Read/Unread, Previewing and Checked;\nretain actual checkboxes and focus outline.\nMenu heading states this message/sender N.\nRationale: labels supplement color and make\npreview-versus-action scope inspectable.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
