      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "tradeoffs-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 2550,
      "width": 737.1,
      "height": 337.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#172b4d",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 57,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1057,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TRADEOFFS / deliberate, not universally better\n\n1. Full-width Review improves outcome detail and avoids a\n   hidden Apply, but costs a task switch and simultaneous\n   Inbox/bin visibility. Keep counts and return position.\n\n2. Retiring Auto-apply reduces Archive/Trash mode changes,\n   but slows trusted-rule throughput and changes a saved\n   preference. Explicit import notice; no silent conversion.\n\n3. Literal states, larger text and persistent More consume\n   row space. Fewer messages fit; subjects wrap before labels.\n   Scroll rather than shrink type to preserve density.\n\n4. Ctrl+Enter becomes safer but breaks existing muscle memory.\n   Show its new meaning in the bar; never submit on that key.",
      "originalText": "TRADEOFFS / deliberate, not universally better\n\n1. Full-width Review improves outcome detail and avoids a\n   hidden Apply, but costs a task switch and simultaneous\n   Inbox/bin visibility. Keep counts and return position.\n\n2. Retiring Auto-apply reduces Archive/Trash mode changes,\n   but slows trusted-rule throughput and changes a saved\n   preference. Explicit import notice; no silent conversion.\n\n3. Literal states, larger text and persistent More consume\n   row space. Fewer messages fit; subjects wrap before labels.\n   Scroll rather than shrink type to preserve density.\n\n4. Ctrl+Enter becomes safer but breaks existing muscle memory.\n   Show its new meaning in the bar; never submit on that key.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
